<div class="space-y-5">
  <div>
    <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">Media Messages</h4>
    <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Send and receive images, videos, audio files, and documents through WhatsApp. Media messages appear as rich content with inline previews.</p>
  </div>

  <div>
    <h5 class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">Sending Media</h5>
    <ul class="text-xs text-gray-600 space-y-1.5 list-disc pl-4">
      <li>Click the <strong>paperclip icon</strong> next to the message input</li>
      <li>Select a file from your device (image, video, audio, or document)</li>
      <li>The file name will appear as a preview above the input</li>
      <li>Optionally type a caption in the message input</li>
      <li>Click send to deliver the media</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div>
    <h5 class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">Receiving Media</h5>
    <ul class="text-xs text-gray-600 space-y-1.5 list-disc pl-4">
      <li><strong>Images</strong> display as inline thumbnails — click to view full size</li>
      <li><strong>Videos</strong> appear with playback controls</li>
      <li><strong>Audio</strong> shows an audio player with play/pause</li>
      <li><strong>Documents</strong> show a file icon with filename — click to download</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div>
    <h5 class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">Supported Formats & Limits</h5>
    <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border border-gray-200">
      <table class="w-full divide-y divide-gray-200 text-xs">
        <thead class="bg-gray-50">
          <tr>
            <th class="px-3 py-2 text-left font-semibold text-gray-500">Type</th>
            <th class="px-3 py-2 text-left font-semibold text-gray-500">Formats</th>
            <th class="px-3 py-2 text-left font-semibold text-gray-500">Max Size</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody class="divide-y divide-gray-100">
          <tr><td class="px-3 py-2 text-gray-700 font-medium">Image</td><td class="px-3 py-2 text-gray-600">JPEG, PNG</td><td class="px-3 py-2 text-gray-600">5 MB</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="px-3 py-2 text-gray-700 font-medium">Video</td><td class="px-3 py-2 text-gray-600">MP4, 3GPP</td><td class="px-3 py-2 text-gray-600">16 MB</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="px-3 py-2 text-gray-700 font-medium">Audio</td><td class="px-3 py-2 text-gray-600">AAC, MP3, OGG, AMR</td><td class="px-3 py-2 text-gray-600">16 MB</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="px-3 py-2 text-gray-700 font-medium">Document</td><td class="px-3 py-2 text-gray-600">PDF, DOC, XLS, PPT, TXT</td><td class="px-3 py-2 text-gray-600">100 MB</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div>
    <h5 class="text-xs font-semibold text-red-700 mb-2">Common Errors</h5>
    <div class="space-y-2">
      <div class="rounded-lg bg-red-50 border border-red-100 p-3">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-red-800">"Media URL is required"</p>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-red-600 mt-1">No file was selected or the file URL is empty. Select a valid file before sending.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg bg-red-50 border border-red-100 p-3">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-red-800">"Media file too large"</p>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-red-600 mt-1">The file exceeds WhatsApp's size limits. Compress or resize the file before sending.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg bg-red-50 border border-red-100 p-3">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-red-800">"Unsupported media type"</p>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-red-600 mt-1">The file format is not supported. Convert to a supported format (see table above).</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
